{"version":3,"term":{"cols":100,"rows":36},"timestamp":1787271920,"command":"python3 run_demo.py","env":{"SHELL":"/bin/zsh"}}
[0.180, "o", "\u001b[1m=== ADR-0114: sandbox residency and pre-binding ===\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mA Curie turn costs 2-9% of one core; almost all of a turn is waiting on the model.\r\nWhat costs real time is STARTING a conversation, and a hard 90s deadline sits on it.\r\nThis cluster: fake model, no observability stack, 6,961-byte bundle, gVisor off.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m[1/5] Today: a new conversation on a quiet node\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[2mclaim carries the bundle ref as per-claim env, so the pod is built from scratch\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.140, "o", "    \u001b[2m  0.08s\u001b[0m  claim applied (with per-claim env)\r\n"]
[0.050, "o", "    \u001b[2m  0.13s\u001b[0m  bound to sandbox probe-a\r\n    \u001b[2m  0.13s\u001b[0m  claim Ready=False (DependenciesNotReady)\r\n"]
[4.546, "o", "    \u001b[2m  4.68s\u001b[0m  claim Ready=True (DependenciesReady)\r\n"]
[0.042, "o", "    \u001b[2m  4.72s\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mRUNNER READY\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m[2/5] The same claim, node under contention\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[2mthis is the shape of the incident: claimTimeoutSeconds is 90\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.052, "o", "      \u001b[33m18 neighbours requesting 200m each; critical path requests 50m. 4:1.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[32.282, "o", "      \u001b[2mnode saturated\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[3.127, "o", "    \u001b[2m  1.38s\u001b[0m  claim applied (with per-claim env)\r\n"]
[2.453, "o", "    \u001b[2m  3.83s\u001b[0m  bound to sandbox probe-b\r\n    \u001b[2m  3.83s\u001b[0m  claim Ready=False (SandboxNotReady)\r\n"]
[87.187, "o", "    \u001b[2m 91.02s\u001b[0m  \u001b[31mclaimTimeoutSeconds (90s) EXCEEDED -- in production the worker gives up here; three of these escalate as runner-error\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.034, "o", "    \u001b[2m111.05s\u001b[0m  \u001b[31mgave up after 110s\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[36.578, "o", "      \u001b[2mcontention removed, node quiet again\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.005, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m[3/5] Decision 3: a warm pool keyed by version\u001b[0m\r\n      \u001b[2mthe bundle is baked into the pool's template, not injected per claim\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[6.464, "o", "      \u001b[32m2 pods pre-fetched, pre-extracted, pre-booted (6s, paid once)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m[4/5] A claim carrying no env binds a pre-booted pod\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.140, "o", "    \u001b[2m  0.09s\u001b[0m  claim applied (no env)\r\n"]
[0.048, "o", "    \u001b[2m  0.13s\u001b[0m  bound to sandbox probe-vk-pool-j46zc\r\n    \u001b[2m  0.13s\u001b[0m  claim Ready=True (DependenciesReady)\r\n"]
[0.037, "o", "    \u001b[2m  0.17s\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mRUNNER READY\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m[5/5] The same pre-bound claim, the same contention\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.048, "o", "      \u001b[33m18 neighbours requesting 200m each; critical path requests 50m. 4:1.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.017, "o", "      \u001b[2mnode saturated\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[2.434, "o", "    \u001b[2m  0.63s\u001b[0m  claim applied (no env)\r\n"]
[6.427, "o", "    \u001b[2m  7.06s\u001b[0m  bound to sandbox probe-vk-pool-7sv2w\r\n    \u001b[2m  7.06s\u001b[0m  claim Ready=True (DependenciesReady)\r\n"]
[0.734, "o", "    \u001b[2m  7.79s\u001b[0m  \u001b[32mRUNNER READY\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[39.761, "o", "      \u001b[2mcontention removed, node quiet again\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.005, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m=== result ===\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "                            quiet node    under contention\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  today (cold create)            4.72s           timed out\r\n  pre-bound (ADR-0114)           0.17s               7.79s\r\n\r\n  \u001b[32m28x faster on a quiet node\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[32munder contention the 90s deadline is no longer reachable (7.79s)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[2mThe cold baseline is cluster-shaped: 4-5s here, and 17.39s measured on a\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "real-model install with Langfuse and ClickHouse resident. The arm that matters is\r\nthe middle column: today's path does not finish, and a pre-bound one does.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
